 'Start with the relationship between the weather and the leak. Record whether the room below becomes wet during the rain, several hours afterwards or only after repeated wet days. Note whether wind from a particular direction seems to matter. A leak after balcony washing is also worth recording, but do not recreate it deliberately. These observations help define an inspection; none proves that a membrane has failed.':'先记录天气与漏水的关系：楼下房间是在下雨时、数小时后，还是连续雨天后受潮，是否受特定风向影响。阳台清洗后出现漏水也值得说明，但不要故意重现。这些现象有助于安排检查，本身都不能证明防水层已经失效。',
 'A balcony assessment needs to look beyond the open tiled area. Relevant locations include the drain connection, door threshold, wall junctions, exposed edges, movement joints and penetrations for fittings. The assessor should identify the balcony construction and which details are accessible rather than treating every tiled deck as the same assembly.':'阳台检查不只看中间的铺砖区域，还要考虑排水口连接、门槛、墙面接缝、外露边缘、伸缩缝及配件穿出部位，并确认阳台构造和可检查的细节，不能把所有铺砖阳台都当成同一种结构。',
