 'Resealing does not restore swollen, softened or delaminated cabinet board. It can address a confirmed joint leak, but the damaged material remains a separate issue. Replacing the board while the source is unresolved risks exposing the new material to the same water. Establish the leak path first, agree the repair, then assess what cabinet work is needed.':'重新密封不能恢复膨胀、软化或分层的柜板。它可以处理已确认的接缝漏水，但柜板损坏仍需另外处理。未解决水源就更换柜板，新材料仍可能再次受潮。应先查明漏水路径、确认维修，再评估柜体恢复工作。',
 'distinguishes traffic and full-cure stages and notes temperature effects. Those figures belong to that product and stated conditions; they should not become a standard downtime promise for every repair.':'区分了可通行与完全固化等阶段，并说明温度的影响。这些数据仅对应该产品及其规定条件，不能作为所有维修统一的停用时间承诺。',
